WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
We've implemented the largest tax cuts in American history

00:04.000 --> 00:08.160
and the largest regulation cuts in American history,

00:08.160 --> 00:11.460
making this once and again the best country

00:11.460 --> 00:13.460
on Earth to do business.

00:13.460 --> 00:17.840
And many of the people in this room are investing in America,

00:17.840 --> 00:20.000
and it's turned out to be an awfully good investment

00:20.000 --> 00:22.000
during this eight-month period.

